{"notebook":"nb1","page":10,"seed":10,"says":"Halfway through the afternoon I want to stop and count. So: the pencil at life size again, in the same spot as page one, with a dotted ghost where the rest of it used to be. Thirteen tally strokes. And the shavings, which is where your friend the sharpener has been putting my pencil; I thought you should have to look at them. The coin rubbing I owed you is here too, life size, side of the lead. Underfur and a dark room behind the cat: both right, both too late for her. The next animal or the next evening gets them.","before":{"length":139.86493689427604,"worn":0.018113287468894762,"eraser":10.898879256580623,"sharpenings":13,"graphite":8.226355262967704,"distance":195361.63705802828},"after":{"length":137.82140680994516,"worn":0.012711219030053239,"eraser":10.898879256580623,"sharpenings":14,"graphite":8.381580536183264,"distance":202394.62041977304},"stats":{"strokeM":7.032983361751533,"graphite":0.15522527321552332,"used":2.0435300843308823,"sharpenings":1,"erasedMm2":0,"coverage":0.007134825948712682,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"3:00. Taking stock.","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"write","text":"Thirteen sharpenings. 35 mm gone, 52 left to spend. The sharpener has had about as much as the paper has.","x":14,"y":40,"width":90},{"op":"line","x1":16,"y1":91,"x2":16.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":19,"y1":91,"x2":19.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":22,"y1":91,"x2":22.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":25,"y1":91,"x2":25.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":14,"y1":99,"x2":27,"y2":92,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":36,"y1":91,"x2":36.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":39,"y1":91,"x2":39.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":42,"y1":91,"x2":42.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":45,"y1":91,"x2":45.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":34,"y1":99,"x2":47,"y2":92,"pressure":1},{"op":"line","x1":56,"y1":91,"x2":56.6,"y2":100,"pressure":1}